.SH NAME
ssoossh-host-mapping-add - Add a principal to an account's mapping.


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBssoossh host mapping add [flags] [args]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Adds a principal to the given account, deduplicating if already present. Validates principal syntax before writing.


